libmarinholab-solver-qpoales (26.09.00) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian package of the C++ part of the solver-qpoales project:
    the marinholab::solvers::qpoales library (Solver + Configuration) and
    its qpOASES dependency, built with CMake and -O3.
    The pybind11 Python extension is not packaged; it is built by
    `pip install .`.

